    "detailed_description": "The planet of slimes was quiet until the dusters came here. Aliens from outer space, they turned blooming fields into a desert, gentle winds into sandstorms, and plants into dust. Gather the slimes and lead them into battle against the invaders. It is up to you to make this planet bloom again!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><strong></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build slime squads using factories and send them into battle<br></li><li>Collect the gel of fallen slimes and reuse it<br></li><li>Improve your own factories and slimes between attacks<br></li><li>Research new upgrades between battles<br></li><li>Each type of slime is special, plan a wise strategy to overcome the enemy</li></ul>",
